{
  "rationale": "Use a small plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in specifications. The policy gives priority to forward progress in clear conditions, uses one-shot conservative recovery after obstacle events, keeps action states robust to open-loop pulse semantics by self-looping on non-critical path_clear, and returns quickly to forward exploration once clear.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate uncontrollable perception from controllable motion with two plant automata",
    "Use one policy specification with perception states and one-shot action states to enforce safe, progress-biased recovery"
